- Ibu.
- Ting.

20:48.760 --> 20:49.680
Ibu.

20:51.760 --> 20:52.600
Yingying.

20:59.920 --> 21:02.480
Ibu, ayo kita pulang.

21:05.040 --> 21:06.120
Ayo kita pulang.

21:22.680 --> 21:23.640
Yingying,

21:24.480 --> 21:27.040
